OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sun 15 Nov to Tue 24 Nov
OL,6,FAfter being initially settled with
OL,7,Fearly frost, there will be an early
OL,8,Ftransition to more unsettled
OL,9,Fconditions, with areas of low pressure
OL,10,Fmoving in from the North Atlantic,
OL,11,Fbringing with it bands of rain and
OL,12,Fperiods of windy weather. Between
OL,13,Fbands of rain, there will be some
OL,14,Fbrighter, showery spells. Overall,
OL,15,Fthis period is likely to be wetter
OL,16,Fthan average for the majority of the
OL,17,Fcountry. Whilst colder conditions will
OL,18,Fbe possible at times, it will often be
OL,19,Fmild, with temperatures near or a
OL,20,Flittle above average for the time of
OL,21,Fyear.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
