OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 25 Nov to Wed 9 Dec
OL,6,FChangeable or unsettled conditions are
OL,7,Fexpected initially, with Atlantic
OL,8,Fweather systems bringing spells of
OL,9,Frain and strong winds at times,
OL,10,Finterspersed with brighter, showery
OL,11,Fperiods. Through late November, low
OL,12,Fpressure may become slower-moving to
OL,13,Fthe west of the UK, potentially
OL,14,Fbringing more prolonged rainfall,
OL,15,Fparticularly to southern and western
OL,16,Fareas, along with a continued risk of
OL,17,Fstrong winds. Into December,
OL,18,Fconfidence becomes low, but there is a
OL,19,Fpossibility that low pressure tracks
OL,20,Fshift further south as high pressure
OL,21,Fbuilds to the north. This could bring
OL,22,Ffurther rain at times to central and
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fsouthern areas, while northern parts
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Fbecome somewhat drier. Temperatures
OL,25,Fwill probably be near or slightly
OL,26,Fabove average in the south, with an
